  "description": "The test configuration conforms to version\u202f2.0.0 and defines a single top\u2011level test fixture named **RootFixture**. This fixture is described as \u201cTop level test fixture containing core tests.\u201d and includes three elements. The first element is the CAPL test case **InitializeSystem** (ID\u202fTC001) titled \u201cSystem Initialization\u201d, which \u201cInitializes the system before tests.\u201d and receives the parameters\u202f\u201cCOM1\u201d and\u202f9600. The second element is a CAPL test sequence **RunDiagnostics**, titled \u201cDiagnostic Sequence\u201d, with the parameters\u202f5 and\u202f\u201cFull\u201d. The third element is a nested test fixture called **NestedFixture**, described as \u201cFixture for communication tests.\u201d.\n\nInside **NestedFixture** there is one CAPL test case, **CheckCANBus**, identified as TC002 and titled \u201cCAN Bus Check\u201d. This case is configured with the parameters\u202f\u201cCAN0\u201d and\u202f500.",
  "reference_json": {
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "test-tree": [
      {
        "test-fixture": "RootFixture",
        "description": "Top level test fixture containing core tests.",
        "elements": [
          {
            "capl-test-case": "InitializeSystem",
            "id": "TC001",
            "title": "System Initialization",
            "description": "Initializes the system before tests.",
            "params": [
              "COM1",
              9600
            ]
          },
          {
            "capl-test-sequence": "RunDiagnostics",
            "title": "Diagnostic Sequence",
            "params": [
              5,
              "Full"
            ]
          },
          {
            "test-fixture": "NestedFixture",
            "description": "Fixture for communication tests.",
            "elements": [
              {
                "capl-test-case": "CheckCANBus",
                "id": "TC002",
                "title": "CAN Bus Check",
                "params": [
                  "CAN0",
                  500
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}